# DarkShield AI - Environment Configuration Example
# ===================================================
# Note: The system runs completely offline out of the box using deterministic
# grounded rule & Calibrated SVM models. All cloud AI features (LLM & Vision AI)
# are 100% optional. If keys are omitted, offline mode is automatically engaged.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Screenshot Vision AI (Optional - Analyzes visual layout, button contrast, & timers)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VISION_PROVIDER=gemini        # Options: "gemini" (default) or "openai"
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
#
# Or OpenAI Vision:
# VISION_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
# OPENAI_VISION_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. LLM Contextual Narrative Explainer (Optional - Generates consumer impact advice)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If GEMINI_API_KEY or OPENAI_API_KEY is already supplied above, it will also be
# automatically used for LLM text explanations.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
